    title: "ADR-0047 rulings 3/4: a user's catalogue data gets a home under $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/hypergumbo, created by an explicit subcommand"  # 04a2
    status: todo_hard  # 04a2
    priority: 2  # 04a2
    parent:  # 04a2
    tags:  # 04a2
    - adr_0047  # 04a2
